WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,000
so fast

2
00:00:05,190 --> 00:00:06,490
The Lu family knows what’s appropriate

3
00:00:06,490 --> 00:00:07,790
It will also contain the Su family

4
00:00:07,790 --> 00:00:09,190
Let them go there themselves

5
